BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:93rd session
DTSTART:20261005T080000Z
DTEND:20261030T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20261013T122300Z
UID:indico-event-1017962@indico.un.org
CONTACT:ohchr-cedaw@un.org
DESCRIPTION:The 93rd session of the Committee on the Elimination of Discri
 mination against Women (CEDAW) will take place from 5 to 30 October 2026 a
 t the Palais des Nations.\nFor further information\, please consult the we
 bpage for the 93rd session.\nAll public meetings of the Committee will b
 e webcast live on the following website: https://webtv.un.org/en.\nUNOG D
 igital Badging System\nConference participants will receive a digital badg
 e that includes their photo\, a QR code\, and the conference name and date
 s. The badge will be sent by email once accreditation has been approved by
  the conference organizer. After downloading it to a mobile phone or other
  mobile device\, participants can use the digital badge for faster access 
 to the Palais des Nations\, avoiding the time required to issue a physical
  badge. The digital badge may also be printed\, and the QR code will funct
 ion in the same way.\nTo activate the badge\, participants must present th
 e digital badge received by email together with an official identity docum
 ent (passport) at the Pass and Identification Unit in Geneva\, located at 
 the Pregny Gate.\n\nhttps://indico.un.org/event/1017962/
LOCATION:Room XVI (Palais des Nations)
URL:https://indico.un.org/event/1017962/
END:VEVENT
